# What the image build never needs. The build installs its own dependencies and
# builds its own output, so a host's copies of either would only be shipped into
# the build context for nothing — or, worse, copied over the top of the real ones.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
app/dist-pages
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# History and agent worktrees, which can be bigger than everything else together.
.git
.claude

# End-to-end results.
test-results
playwright-report

# Local secrets stay local.
.env
.env.*
